  "solution": {
    "text": "The Direction ratio perpendicular to the plane would be cross product of<br /><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0-</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />= <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />= <math><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> Equation of plane would be<br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br />As plane contain&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />This passes through <math><mo>(</mo><mn>0,7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>)</mo></math>"
